[{"id":"taima-5-93-8","words":["verb:taima"],"options":[{"bs":"jeli su","en":"they ate"},{"bs":"jeli ste","en":"you (all) ate"},{"bs":"kuša je","en":"he/it tastes it"},{"bs":"jede ih","en":"he/it eats them"}],"ref":"5:93","answerWord":"طَعِمُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/909d1de22da32584004b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There shall be no sin (imputed) unto those who believe and do good works for what they may have eaten (in the past). So be mindful of your duty (to Allah), and believe, and do good works; and again: be mindful of your duty, and believe; and once again: be mindful of your duty, and do right. Allah loveth the good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"jesti, okusiti","en":"to eat, to taste"},"passage":["لَيْسَ","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","جُنَاحٌ","فِيمَا","طَعِمُوٓا۟","إِذَا","مَا","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّءَامَنُوا۟","ثُمَّ","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّأَحْسَنُوا۟","وَٱللَّهُ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"طَعِمَ"}},{"id":"taima-6-138-6","words":["verb:taima"],"options":[{"bs":"jede ih","en":"he/it eats them"},{"bs":"kuša je","en":"he/it tastes it"},{"bs":"jeli su","en":"they ate"},{"bs":"jeli ste","en":"you (all) ate"}],"ref":"6:138","answerWord":"يَطْعَمُهَآ","answerSound":"audio/9bab5091628173978814.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they say: Such cattle and crops are forbidden. No-one is to eat of them save whom we will - in their make-believe - cattle whose backs are forbidden, cattle over which they mention not the name of Allah. (All that is) a lie against Him. He will repay them for that which they invent.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"jesti, okusiti","en":"to eat, to taste"},"passage":["وَقَالُوا۟","هَٰذِهِۦٓ","أَنْعَٰمٌ","وَحَرْثٌ","حِجْرٌ","لَّا","يَطْعَمُهَآ","إِلَّا","مَن","نَّشَآءُ","بِزَعْمِهِمْ","وَأَنْعَٰمٌ","حُرِّمَتْ","ظُهُورُهَا","وَأَنْعَٰمٌ","لَّا","يَذْكُرُونَ","ٱسْمَ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَيْهَا","ٱفْتِرَآءً","عَلَيْهِ","سَيَجْزِيهِم","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"طَعِمَ"}}]